><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>CSuite Code offers website development, IT support, technology consulting, and managed services tailored for small to medium businesses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/pane -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/pane {\"id\":8,\"titleTag\":\"h3\",\"uniqueID\":\"61_45793c-32\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-8 kt-pane61_45793c-32\"><h3 class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">How does the project-based pricing work?</span></span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"></span></button></h3><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We offer competitive project-based pricing, ensuring you receive the best value for your technology needs without hidden fees.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/pane -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/pane {\"id\":9,\"titleTag\":\"h3\",\"uniqueID\":\"61_7c25d4-8d\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-9 kt-pane61_7c25d4-8d\"><h3 class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">What is a fractional CTO?</span></span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"></span></button></h3><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A fractional CTO is a part-time Chief Technology Officer who provides strategic technology guidance to businesses without the full-time cost.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:kadence/pane -->\n\n<!-- wp:kadence/pane {\"id\":10,\"titleTag\":\"h3\",\"unique